  "created": "2026-07-07T13:32:38.233Z",
  "description": "Public TinyRustLM .NET SDK for UAIX.org .uai AI memory packages, AI Memory Package Wizard workflows, discoverable setup catalog, embedded AI digest adoption, point-agent setup URLs, canonical starter ZIP guidance, Safe Structured Output review boundaries, file handoff, LLM Wiki memory layouts, multi-agent communication records, Talisman System anchor-governance review records, and advanced persona personality-pack validation. It plans required files including agent-pickup.uai, session-log.uai, manifest overlay, package model, knowledge graph, llms.uai, and llms-full.uai exports; inspects .uai folders, .zip and .uaix archives without extraction; inspects memory manifest JSON; and reports advanced persona .uaix, ZIP, and TXT deck expectations plus dimension evidence for depth_level_0_to_10, disclosure boundaries, source confidence, triggered style axes, and non-inference rules for TinyRustLM runtime consumers. This package backs the UAIX.Browser.Memory local feed identity while keeping hosted import validation, automatic repository writes, automatic LLM Wiki sync, persona-fidelity certification, memory ranking, and private optimization logic out of the package.",
